{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton","id":1303088,"title":"Upcoming Dragon Blooded Interview with Eric Minton","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-06T09:04:33-07:00","id":1303088,"title":"Upcoming Dragon Blooded Interview with Eric Minton","content":"Hello,<br /> <br /> Next weekend, I'll be interviewing Eric Minton on all topics Dragon Blooded. I'll have a list of questions of my own, but I want to open the opportunity for forum users to submit questions as well. I'll tend toward longer-form, open ended questions since Eri is very accessible in the ask the dev's thread for shorter questions. The episode will air in May.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":702,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","user":"ElfSpeaker","date":". 04-06-2019, 01:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T10:21:46-07:00","id":1303110,"title":"","content":"Pretty sure it's &quot;Eric,&quot; with a &quot;C.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T10:44:07-07:00","id":1303116,"title":"","content":"Thank you. I can\u2019t update the topic title unfortunately.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T11:56:38-07:00","id":1303147,"title":"","content":"This isn't a long-form question, and perhaps not even relevant, I guess. Sorry!<br /> <br /> I've personally always preferred the term &quot;Terrestrial&quot; to &quot;Dragon-Blooded&quot;. While it's technically a legacy term to differentiate Dragon-Blooded from the Celestial Exalted and denote a lower power level, it's been a group that so far has only contained the Dragon-Blooded, so it's worked out to equate the names. It also fits very well with their physical elemental connection. Does Eric see any issues with using the term &quot;Terrestrial&quot; (other than baggage) and is it likely that any other group of Exalts will be formally added to the Terrestrial group?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T12:21:42-07:00","id":1303154,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303116#post1303116\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thank you. I can\u2019t update the topic title unfortunately.</div> </div> </div> </div>Don't worry, I got it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T13:01:25-07:00","id":1303162,"title":"","content":"Hmm. I guess this might be more a question for Vance but it would be nice to know why aura isn't spread uniformly. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303147#post1303147\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This isn't a long-form question, and perhaps not even relevant, I guess. Sorry!<br /> <br /> I've personally always preferred the term &quot;Terrestrial&quot; to &quot;Dragon-Blooded&quot;. While it's technically a legacy term to differentiate Dragon-Blooded from the Celestial Exalted and denote a lower power level, it's been a group that so far has only contained the Dragon-Blooded, so it's worked out to equate the names. It also fits very well with their physical elemental connection. Does Eric see any issues with using the term &quot;Terrestrial&quot; (other than baggage) and is it likely that any other group of Exalts will be formally added to the Terrestrial group?</div> </div> </div> </div>Terrestrial doesn't simply apply to dragon blooded in this edition it's a catch all term for exalted at that level. Like celestial denotes lunar, sidereal, and solar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T13:39:38-07:00","id":1303168,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303162#post1303162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm. I guess this might be more a question for Vance but it would be nice to know why aura isn't spread uniformly. </div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m curious, can you clarify what you mean by that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T13:46:12-07:00","id":1303170,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303168#post1303168\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I\u2019m curious, can you clarify what you mean by that?</div> </div> </div> </div>The aura mechanic is an important mechanic for dragon blooded but certain things are impossible but there aren't uniform trees following specific elements. In each ability, instead there's a major element for each ability followed by every other element getting a scattering of charms. In essence, it makes it kind of difficult to use certain combinations of combat abilities with each other and keep aura up. That can sometimes be negated by the keyword balanced or dual but that's not present in certain things.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T14:09:16-07:00","id":1303177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303162#post1303162\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Terrestrial doesn't simply apply to dragon blooded in this edition it's a catch all term for exalted at that level.</div> </div> </div> </div>No it isn't; Liminal Exalted might be referred to as being &quot;Terrestrial level&quot; to give a sense of their overall power, but they're not Terrestrial Exalted. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T15:25:50-07:00","id":1303199,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303177#post1303177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No it isn't; Liminal Exalted might be referred to as being &quot;Terrestrial level&quot; to give a sense of their overall power, but they're not Terrestrial Exalted.</div> </div> </div> </div>Last time I checked terrestrial level and terrestrial exalt were the same. Such as celestial exalt and celestial level. They were used to denote a type of exalt in the most basic sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T15:30:16-07:00","id":1303201,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303199#post1303199\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Last time I checked</div> </div> </div> </div>Where?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T15:48:44-07:00","id":1303206,"title":"","content":"&quot;Terrestrial&quot; is used specifically to refer to the Dragon-Blooded in 3e.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted.<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1120-eric-minton","name":"Eric Minton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1120_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2000"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T16:44:00-07:00","id":1303218,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Minton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303206#post1303206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Terrestrial&quot; is used specifically to refer to the Dragon-Blooded in 3e.</div> </div> </div> </div>So is there a general term for that level?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T18:40:21-07:00","id":1303229,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303218#post1303218\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So is there a general term for that level?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> There are levels?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1229925-hello-i-did-up-a-scavenger-lands-map-based-on-3e\" target=\"_blank\">3e Scavenger Lands map</a><br /> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/a/NQewCv0\" target=\"_blank\">3e Combat tracker card</a><br /> <a href=\"https://imgur.com/uGrZk2r\" target=\"_blank\">2e Nexus map</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1079-megapope","name":"Megapope","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1079_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"75"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T19:23:50-07:00","id":1303232,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Megapope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303229#post1303229\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> There are levels?</div> </div> </div> </div>The strength and prowess of an exalt depends on what type of exalt they are. There is a clear difference of power between a dragon-blooded and a solar. However, celestials (Sidereals, lunars, solars) are closer to one another in capability than a dragon blooded or liminal. In 2e, while there wasn't more exalts, it always seemed like terrestrial was just the general term for any exalt that wasn't as strong as a celestial. But dragon-blooded were the specific exalted which manifested power from the elements.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":116,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","user":"Epimetheus","date":". 04-06-2019, 10:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-06T21:20:15-07:00","id":1303243,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epimetheus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303232#post1303232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The strength and prowess of an exalt depends on what type of exalt they are. There is a clear difference of power between a dragon-blooded and a solar. However, celestials (Sidereals, lunars, solars) are closer to one another in capability than a dragon blooded or liminal. In 2e, while there wasn't more exalts, it always seemed like terrestrial was just the general term for any exalt that wasn't as strong as a celestial. But dragon-blooded were the specific exalted which manifested power from the elements.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think in 3e, Celestial is a term more important in describing the three Exalts whose Exaltation is more like one-another (inheritable, chosen by the gods of the seven planets) than anything to do with power a lot of the time also.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T01:30:14-07:00","id":1303267,"title":"","content":"Yeah, &quot;Celestial&quot; means &quot;positioned in or pertaining to the sky,&quot; it doesn't have anything to do with power levels. If the Elemental Dragons were planets instead of hanging around at the Elemental Poles, the Dragon-Blooded would get called Celestial, too.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T04:12:40-07:00","id":1303283,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure in 3e &quot;Celestial&quot; is a circle of sorcery and not much else.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T06:05:22-07:00","id":1303305,"title":"","content":"Well, I'll point out that &quot;Terrestrial&quot; is an actual mechanical keyword. Which currently only applies to Dragonblood martial arts (who are, as Alucard points out, exalted of the Terrestrial elements, not Celestial objects), but could perhaps be used by other splats in future.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T11:39:41-07:00","id":1303373,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eric Minton</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303206#post1303206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Terrestrial&quot; is used specifically to refer to the Dragon-Blooded in 3e.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for your reply.<br /> <br /> Didn't mean to hijack the thread with semantics. Sorry about that!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T11:54:21-07:00","id":1303376,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Weimann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1303373#post1303373\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks for your reply.<br /> <br /> Didn't mean to hijack the thread with semantics. Sorry about that!</div> </div> </div> </div>No worries! Just come round and give the show a listen to make up for it. ;-)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T13:46:11-07:00","id":1303402,"title":"","content":"I don't have specific questions (as you can ask those in the Ask the Devs thread) but I'd be interested in his thoughts on satrapies, why they chose the satrapies they did for the Realm, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T15:19:04-07:00","id":1303417,"title":"","content":"Actual questions:<br /> <br /> Are there any Abilities you think could have used more elemental representation? (Probably more Vacne's take but whatever.)<br /> <br /> Is there anything that you think was really wanted to talk about that in the end didn't end up being able to be discussed in either DB:WFHW, its companion or The Realm?<br /> <br /> Is there any particular setting thing in the Dragon-Blooded lore you'd probably have liked to do more to change, but probably is a bit too &quot;baked in&quot; to the way the setting has portrayed them to now?<br /> <br /> What in particular unique to the 3e take on the DB setting material you think was especially interesting, exciting to write about, or what have you?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-07T18:20:25-07:00","id":1303445,"title":"","content":"Does the DB companion have any new groups in it? If so, can you tell us anything about them?<br /> Are there any cool artifacts in the Companion?<br /> <br /> Since we\u2019ve seen Lunars now, can you talk about how the Realm deals with fighting shapeshifters who could be anyone? Does The Realm discuss it in detail or is it just mentioned in passing?<br /> <br /> Was there any interesting material that had to be cut from any of the three DB centric books that you\u2019d like to revisit later or was/is all the cut stuff just things that didn\u2019t work, pruned words, and the usual writing detritus?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":226,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","user":"BrilliantRain","date":". 04-07-2019, 09:24 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-08T15:20:16-07:00","id":1303629,"title":"","content":"what do you find the most fun playing a DB, what was one of you most favorite moments as one?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#b22222\"><b>.</b></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3742-iceblade44","name":"Iceblade44","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"707"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-14T06:40:31-07:00","id":1304797,"title":"","content":"Questions are officially closed. I'll be talking to Eric in a couple of hours. Thank you all for contributing","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-20T04:12:02-07:00","id":1313277,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#1D2129\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">We have just aired the interview. I hope you enjoy the episode: </span></span></span></span><a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/episode-27-exalted-dragon-blooded-with-eric-minton\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#365899\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\">http://thestorytold.libsyn.com/episode-27-exalted-dragon-blooded-with-eric-minton</span></span></span></span></span></a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":702,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","user":"ElfSpeaker","date":". 05-20-2019, 12:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-20T09:25:43-07:00","id":1313318,"title":"","content":"Two things:<br /> <br /> First, that isn't a link, just formatted text. Anyone who wants to listen to the interview will need to copy and paste it into their address bar.<br /> <br /> Second, is there any chance we could get a transcript? I'm very interested in this interview, but I rarely find the time (and focus) to listen to a whole podcast.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-20T09:34:54-07:00","id":1313320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The MG</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1313318#post1313318\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Two things:<br /> <br /> First, that isn't a link, just formatted text. Anyone who wants to listen to the interview will need to copy and paste it into their address bar.<br /> <br /> Second, is there any chance we could get a transcript? I'm very interested in this interview, but I rarely find the time (and focus) to listen to a whole podcast.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Thank you, I've updated the URL to be a link.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, I don't have the time to create a transcript. I'd be happy to post and share it if someone would like to volunteer to produce it. I'd also provide the questions in written form to help.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-20T11:23:58-07:00","id":1313342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1313320#post1313320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> Thank you, I've updated the URL to be a link.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, I don't have the time to create a transcript. I'd be happy to post and share it if someone would like to volunteer to produce it. I'd also provide the questions in written form to help.</div> </div> </div> </div>If you\u2019ll post the list of questions in the thread, I\u2019ll see what I can do about positing abbreviated versions of the answers after I listen to the podcast. Should be in the next day or two.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-20T11:47:25-07:00","id":1313348,"title":"","content":"Here are the questions as written in the outline. We deviated a bit from how they're written here:<br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">You\u2019ve been on the show before so you\u2019ve answered our origin story question, so I have to get creative. If you lived in Creation, where would you want to live?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I know that all of the Exalted could be your favorite, but what makes Dragon-Blooded your favorite of the Exalted?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Can you tell me about one of your Dragon-Blooded characters? What do you find the most fun playing a DB? what was one of you most favorite moments as one?</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">What themes do you think are interesting to highlight for the Dragon-Blooded?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Where do you personally look for inspiration for the Dragon-Blooded and what do you take from each of those sources?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">What in particular unique to the 3e take on the DB setting material you think was especially interesting, exciting to write about, or what have you?</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">One of the original stated goals of What Fire Has Wrought was to make each of the houses iconic and compelling, a goal that I personally feel was achieved. Were any of the Houses particularly difficult to get right?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Another goal of the Dragon-Blooded book was to highlight the story of the Dragon Blooded beyond the Realm, and the book included information about Lookshy as well as several Outcast groups. Do you have a personal favorite group of DBs beyond the Realm?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">My co-host has said that he feels like 3rd edition dilutes the strong elemental associations of the DB aspects by removing the surcharge for using non-aspect elemental charms and by letting every Dragon-Blooded express every element through each ability and through the Auras. Can you talk about the development thinking that went into these changes and talk about the role of the aspects for characters?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Is there any particular setting thing in the Dragon-Blooded lore you'd probably have liked to do more to change, but probably is a bit too &quot;baked in&quot; to the way the setting has portrayed them to now?</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">WFHW does not include a storyteller section. What guidance would you give to folks interested in running a Dragon-Blooded game?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Realm</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Realm is moving ever closer to Release and is going to discuss the Blessed Isle, the Threshold Satrapies, and the Empire of Prasaad along with the institutions and culture of Creation\u2019s greatest empire. Have I overlooked anything that\u2019s going into that book?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Personally, I\u2019m excited to learn more about the Satrapies presented in the Realm. Can you share any updates old favorites or completely new entries?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Why did you pick the Satrapies that ended up appearing in the book?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">I\u2019ve always felt that beyond the Secondary Schools, the Blessed Isle was less compelling than other areas of Creation to set a game. What will the Realm do to change that perception?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Since we\u2019ve seen Lunars now, can you talk about how the Realm deals with fighting shapeshifters who could be anyone? Does The Realm discuss it in detail or is it just mentioned in passing?</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Between Lunars and the Realm, we\u2019re getting a lot of details about the Caul, which is a new micro-continent in the West. Can you talk about what makes the Caul interesting and why it was added to Creation?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Heirs to the Shogunate</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Heirs to the Shounate includes all of the cool extras that were added during the Kickstarter Campaign. What are you most excited for to come out of that project?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Can you talk about what\u2019s up with the forest witches? Why do you think they\u2019re so popular and what additional information will we learn about them Heirs of the Shogunate?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Lookshy is getting additional coverage in Heirs. In past editions, their reliance on First Age artifice and access to a reliable cache of weapons and other technology was key part of their position as a bulwark against the Realm in the Scavenger Lands. How and why has that depiction changed in 3rd edition?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Are there any totally new outcast groups you\u2019re willing to share with use that will appear in Heirs?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Can you talk about any of the artifacts that appear in Heirs?</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Listener Inspired Questions</span></span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton\"><span style=\"color:#1155CC\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton</span></span></a><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Are there any Dragon-Blooded topics that you wanted to include but that didn\u2019t make it into the big book, the Realm, or Heirs?</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Was there any interesting material that had to be cut from any of the three DB centric books that you\u2019d like to revisit later or was/is all the cut stuff just things that didn\u2019t work, pruned words, and the usual writing detritus?</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Let\u2019s talk about the term \u201cTerrestrial Exalted\u201d. What does it mean in the context of Exalted 3rd Edition? Is there a general term for exalted who are not as powerful as the celestial exalted?</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">How much were aura\u2019s kept in mind as elements were being picked for Charms? Each ability has a core element, with a scattering of other charms, which can make it difficult to use particular abilities to their best while maintaining a particular elemental aura.</span></span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Are there any Abilities you think could have used more elemental representation?</span><br /> <span style=\"font-family:Arial\">And last question, how do you pronounce the name of the Empress\u2019s eldest living daughter?</span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my RPG podcast: <a href=\"http://thestorytold.libsyn.com\" target=\"_blank\">The Story Told</a><br /> Follow my ongoing Exalted Campaign: <a href=\"https://thefallofjiara.obsidianportal.com/adventure-log\" target=\"_blank\">The Fall of Jiara</a><br /> Check out my Community Content: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Chazz%20Kellner\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....hazz%20Kellner</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/702-elfspeaker","name":"ElfSpeaker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar702_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-22T08:33:16-07:00","id":1313676,"title":"","content":"That's quite useful, thanks. I don't really have time to listen to a podcast for 45 minutes, but I wanted to see what Eric said about the Realm.<br /> <br /> Okay, so the Realm has a chapter on Satrapies, a chapter on the Immaculate Order, a chapter on locations in the Realm, a chapter about the bureaucracy, a chapter on the military.<br /> <br /> Satrapies include three old ones from 1st and 2nd ed (inc. Greyfalls and Cherak), and the rest are new or from the 3rd ed Core, like Pneuma and Prasad.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-06-02T13:34:24-07:00","id":1316146,"title":"","content":"<br /> Sorry this took me awhile to do. I ended up busier than I thought. I'm going to paraphrase these answers, so I apologize if I misrepresent anything and any such was unintentional. Feel free to correct me if I do get anything wrong.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ElfSpeaker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1303088-upcoming-dragon-blooded-interview-with-eric-minton?p=1313348#post1313348\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Here are the questions as written in the outline. We deviated a bit from how they're written here:<br /> <br /> You\u2019ve been on the show before so you\u2019ve answered our origin story question, so I have to get creative. If you lived in Creation, where would you want to live?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Realm, as it's where I'm least likely to get enslaved, tortured, dragged into war, etc. While that makes me part of a huge exploitative empire, it wouldn't be something I have any control over. Creation is a pretty miserable place to live in a lot of ways.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I know that all of the Exalted could be your favorite, but what makes Dragon-Blooded your favorite of the Exalted? </div> </div> </div>They're good in play because they're not so over the top. You can have lower level stories where you don't just steamroll everything. Also there's lots of baked in cultural dynamics.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can you tell me about one of your Dragon-Blooded characters? What do you find the most fun playing a DB? what was one of you most favorite moments as one? </div> </div> </div>Run some Dragon Blooded games and DB NPCs. Lots of hooks right off the bat: families, rivals, etc. So much stuff that's immediately available. He hasn't really gotten to play one.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What themes do you think are interesting to highlight for the Dragon-Blooded? </div> </div> </div>Family, Politics. Also depends on where you are. For Dynasts, how do you fit into the Realm, this world spanning oppressive empire?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Where do you personally look for inspiration for the Dragon-Blooded and what do you take from each of those sources? </div> </div> </div>Actual history, various aristocratic groups, imperial China. Mythology, everyone except Achilles in the Iliad is probably a DB. Sword and Sorcery, Lords of Melnibone, Hawkmoon, Glen Cook's Dread Empire series. Pretty much anywhere you find fantasy aristocracy with magic powers.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> What in particular unique to the 3e take on the DB setting material you think was especially interesting, exciting to write about, or what have you? </div> </div> </div>One of the big agendas was taking the great houses and making them each present a distinct play experience, akin to Vampire clans.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> One of the original stated goals of What Fire Has Wrought was to make each of the houses iconic and compelling, a goal that I personally feel was achieved. Were any of the Houses particularly difficult to get right? </div> </div> </div>House Cynis, because they're the Slavers and Drug Dealers. People are going to go in looking at them as the House of Evil and they are at a very high level, complicit in the stuff that makes the Realm terrible, but it's important not to present them as one dimensional caricatures.<br /> <br /> House Mnemon was also difficult because, previously, they were just &quot;Mnemon's House.&quot; They needed work to present them as an independent culture and actual family.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Another goal of the Dragon-Blooded book was to highlight the story of the Dragon Blooded beyond the Realm, and the book included information about Lookshy as well as several Outcast groups. Do you have a personal favorite group of DBs beyond the Realm? </div> </div> </div>Not really. They're all pretty interesting and were all well executed by the writers.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> My co-host has said that he feels like 3rd edition dilutes the strong elemental associations of the DB aspects by removing the surcharge for using non-aspect elemental charms and by letting every Dragon-Blooded express every element through each ability and through the Auras. Can you talk about the development thinking that went into these changes and talk about the role of the aspects for characters? </div> </div> </div>That's more a Vance question. They didn't want to pigeonhole everyone, because they're not five separate Exalt types, they're all Dragon Blooded.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Is there any particular setting thing in the Dragon-Blooded lore you'd probably have liked to do more to change, but probably is a bit too &quot;baked in&quot; to the way the setting has portrayed them to now? </div> </div> </div>Question Skipped<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> WFHW does not include a storyteller section. What guidance would you give to folks interested in running a Dragon-Blooded game? </div> </div> </div>I don't want to give anything off the cuff because the topic deserves better. We are putting together some bits of advice and guidance in Heirs however. And the Storyteller's Guide is approaching development.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I'll do another post later with the rest of the questions and answers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":226,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","user":"BrilliantRain","date":". 06-02-2019, 04:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}